  "style": "teach_then_qa",
  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "验收程序是在覆盖前拦缺陷",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[hook]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "注意哈，A01 验收程序不是让你背一串名词。它真正考的是现场怎么把缺陷拦在还看得见、够得着、没被盖住的时候。你看这辆检验批小车，如果没有验收就想进下道工序，红闸门会把它挡回来。因为一旦被覆盖，后面再补程序就已经晚了。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 20.496,
      "requestId": "a91d4eec-fafa-9501-bf27-d9b8937e2902",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "self_check",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "先施工自检合格，再报验",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[self_check]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第一步先看报验单有没有自检章。施工单位是质量第一责任人，必须先自检合格，再把成果报出去。监理不是替施工方做初检，监理验的是已经自检合格的成果。画面里没有自检章的报验单会被退回，盖了章才沿蓝色路径往外走。",
      "startSec": 20.896,
      "durSec": 18.336,
      "requestId": "314bb20d-f6f9-9b59-b669-0949b96757f9",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "site_acceptance",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "主控全合格，一般看门槛",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[site_acceptance]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第二步看现场闸门。主控项目不是百分之八十这种口径，它是全合格闸；只要主控项目没过，就不能放行。一般项目才看合格率门槛。这里要诚实一点，具体普适条文边界还要回规范核，但考试表达上，主控和一般必须分开写，不能都写成一个百分比。",
      "startSec": 39.632,
      "durSec": 21.744,
      "requestId": "94e0bddd-0964-9d84-9d50-f7a9cb47bb68",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "record_lift",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "验收记录是上一级证据",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[record_lift]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第三步不要把记录当成后补文书。验收记录是上一级能继续验收的证据。画面里签认笔一落，记录表归档，检验批砖块才会升起来，拼进分项工程层。没有记录，下一层就没有证据可消费。",
      "startSec": 61.776,
      "durSec": 16.104,
      "requestId": "3c327682-67c6-972d-aae2-d5fc3fe7d900",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "level_stack",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "下级合格，才托起上级",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[level_stack]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第四步看层级。质量不是从单位工程往下拆，而是从最小的检验批往上垒。检验批合格，托起分项；分项合格，托起分部；分部合格，最后才托起单位工程。你看白板上如果先把屋顶放上去，它是悬空的。下面没合格，上面就没有验收基础。",
      "startSec": 78.28,
      "durSec": 20.832,
      "requestId": "c860b3b4-f996-9350-a0e9-5b49b3acd4a8",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "reject_branch",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "红灯后走处理分支",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[reject_branch]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第五步看不合格分支。红灯不等于一句全部拆掉，也不等于协商一下就放行。它要分流：能返修返工的，处理后重新验；资料缺失的，可以按规定补证检测；加固后还要重新评估。只有经返修或加固后仍不满足安全或重要使用要求，才走到严禁验收这条终止轨。",
      "startSec": 99.512,
      "durSec": 22.248,
      "requestId": "4026594d-b7b8-98dc-ac69-a3616d8c45fb",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "现场流程压成三句采分话",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[score]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后落到答题纸。第一句，施工单位自检合格后报验。第二句，由监理或建设单位按规定组织验收，形成验收记录。第三句，检验批合格后才进入分项、分部、单位工程逐级验收；不合格要按分支处理，并守住严禁验收红线。这样写，阅卷扫到的是程序动作，不是一串空名词。",
      "startSec": 122.16,
      "durSec": 24.672,
      "requestId": "41eccf5d-957a-9065-aaa7-0a0766432351",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，我直接写检验批、分项、分部、单位，这块能拿分不？",
      "startSec": 147.232,
      "durSec": 5.88,
      "requestId": "4e049f36-e51a-9957-8eb5-4d03a7449d56",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[top_down_order]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "能碰到层级名，但不够稳。程序题要写方向和条件：检验批先合格，再托起分项、分部、单位。只列名词，很容易漏掉“下级合格才上级”这个动作。",
      "startSec": 153.512,
      "durSec": 13.104,
      "requestId": "cf422d31-c901-99fd-89f6-7544e4f064da",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那我让监理先来查，施工单位后面整改，行不行？",
      "startSec": 167.016,
      "durSec": 5.472,
      "requestId": "d2823e69-6f73-97f2-b0c8-956b1c2bd085",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[skip_self_check]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不行。监理验的是施工单位已经自检合格的成果。你把监理放到第一步，就把施工单位的质量责任闭环漏掉了，案例改错会扣程序分。",
      "startSec": 172.888,
      "durSec": 10.632,
      "requestId": "9ff416a7-ff56-984b-b150-3fe2498753e1",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "整明白了，但不合格我写返工重验，是不是就够了？",
      "startSec": 183.92,
      "durSec": 5.808,
      "requestId": "30d938a5-c28f-9343-88ea-3b4c74b3b03e",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[reject_equals_demolish]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "还差一截。返工重验只是一个分支。资料缺失、补证检测、返修加固后评估都可能出现；真正的硬红线是仍不满足安全或重要使用要求的，严禁验收。",
      "startSec": 190.128,
      "durSec": 14.304,
      "requestId": "af9a77fd-5ab2-9d78-a3fe-b737cb1bfcc7",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing_challenge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "memory_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "记住哈，这张卡就一条线：报验单走流程，记录表托上级。先自检，再验收，成记录，合格才放行。现在进闯关，按现场对象流转来练采分句。",
      "startSec": 204.832,
      "durSec": 13.8,
      "requestId": "7d089300-3d86-9b77-a7f7-4a1d01792416",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
}